# w.lang.en/shards/words-k.interest: the English words of k.interest (its types, keys and values), owned by the language world
# (Q78, reviewer 16:10; KR3): they were the core.word facts of its schema; tools/build-catalog.mjs reads them as its own words.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository; the block at the end by tools/key-words.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written); the block of word wires for keys: tools/key-words.mjs

# Words for the types of this world.
@w.lang.en.word.k.interest.world core.word text=interest text=interesting text=interestingness text=curiosity text=boring text=dull means=k.interest.feature core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.word.k.interest.source core.word text=source text=sources text=reference text=references text=paper text=papers means=k.interest.source core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.word.k.interest.appraisal core.word text=appraisal text=appraisals means=k.interest.appraisal core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.word.k.interest.measure core.word text=measure text=measures means=k.interest.measure core.source="hand-core 1"

